{'symbol': 'BR', 'date': '2022-09-21 02:00:00', 'title': "HAMBURG COMMERCIAL BANK TRANSFERS ITS SEPA PROCESSING TO BROADRIDGE'S BPO PAYMENTS SERVICE", 'text': 'AVERAGE STRAIGHT-THROUGH PROCESSING RATE OF 99.9% NEW YORK, LONDON, FRANKFURT AND HAMBURG, GERMANY , SEPT. 21, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- HAMBURG COMMERCIAL BANK (HCOB) HAS SUCCESSFULLY COMPLETED THE TRANSFORMATION OF ITS SEPA (SINGLE EURO PAYMENTS AREA) PAYMENTS BUSINESS TO A CLOUD-BASED, NEXT-GENERATION PLATFORM RUN BY LEADING GLOBAL FINTECH PROVIDER BROADRIDGE FINANCIAL SOLUTIONS, INC. (NYSE:BR).'}